IMPORTANT: the generic text appended AFTER this brief (WORKTREE / merge master / design standard / build / PR rules) does NOT apply to this READ-ONLY hunt. Ignore all of it: make no commit to any code repository, no branch, no file change in any repository except your one findings file (then commit and push that one file in C:\CE_PLAN by name: git fetch, git merge --no-edit origin/main, never rebase, never add -A; leak-scan hook: fix the text and push again, never --no-verify). Do NOT build, run tests, open AutoCAD, install, or spawn sub-agents. Read C:\TimOS\RULES.md first (numbered lists with bold labels, NO TABLES, plain English for Tim above the line, technical below).
