DELIVERABLE: the findings file named below: ANSWER FIRST block (counts HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW; the single most important finding), then numbered findings: severity, file:line, what happens in AutoCAD in plain words for Tim, exact failure scenario, and a DETERMINISTIC TEST (fixture, typed steps or a double-click/right-click on a named object, assertion on command-line text, CE log line, drawing value or window text). Mark verified-by-reading versus suspected. END with a summary under 100 words.
