$hunts = @(
 @('cx_h01_undo', 'CODEX_HUNT_UNDO_22OCT.md', 'UNDO, REDO AND TRANSACTIONS across every Civil command: undo marks (UNDOCTL, UNDOMARKS), one U per command, REDO erased by code that runs on a pick or at open (BUG-861, BUG-416), transactions left open or committed empty, document locks, commands that write in a read-only command, anything run from a reactor or idle handler that writes to the database.'),
