 @('cx_h04_windows', 'CODEX_HUNT_WINDOWS_22OCT.md', 'WPF WINDOWS: every CE window (Edit Pipe, Edit Pit, Edit 2 Pipes, New Pit, Edit source, Settings CDS, Checks palette, What CE Found, X-Civil import, Help Centre, About, Manager windows excluding the parked administrator ones): focus and modality, Esc/Enter/X behaviour, DPI and 150 percent scaling, dark and light, window position on multi-monitor 5120x1440, and TESTABILITY: list every control that lacks AutomationProperties.AutomationId or a Name so a UI Automation test cannot find it.'),
 @('cx_h05_records', 'CODEX_HUNT_RECORDS_22OCT.md', 'PROJECT-DATA RECORDS: the CE record stored in the drawing (pits, pipes, schedule, links, spine IDs): CDSYNC, Pit Schedule, handle changes after copy/paste, WBLOCK, INSERT, XREF bind, save-as, DWG round trip, purge; duplicate or orphan records; ordering; the two hard blocks (delete spine IDs); data loss scenarios.'),
 @('cx_h06_design', 'CODEX_HUNT_DESIGN_22OCT.md', 'LONG SECTION, CDTWL (tail water, freeboard), detention systems, CDRULES R-01..R-30: geometry and numbers: sign conventions, rounding, mm vs m, equality on doubles, off-by-one in pit/pipe indexing, flat/zero-length pipes, pits with 3+ pipes.'),
 @('cx_h07_labels', 'CODEX_HUNT_LABELS_22OCT.md', 'LABELS AND TIDY-UP: tidy labels, text clash, leader-out (card 1.4), label slide, callouts, preview then apply: algorithm bounds, determinism, performance on 2000 labels, locked layers/Xrefs/viewports, hand-placed labels never moved, what the preview says versus what apply does.'),
 @('cx_h08_manager', 'CODEX_HUNT_MANAGER_22OCT.md', 'MANAGER (Civil + Manager colleague release; administrator work is PARKED, ignore it): Manager ribbon/loader, update delivery groundwork (CeFinishUpdatePlanner, staged updates), CE_VERSION window, SafeBundleInstaller and OfficialReleaseGate call paths, first run on a clean profile, what a colleague without Tim folders sees.'),
 @('cx_h09_struct_cmds', 'CODEX_HUNT_STRUCTCMDS_22OCT.md', 'STRUCTURAL COMMANDS (base origin/claude/rel-20261022s2): CSREOBAR, SBEAM, hatch presets (LBUH, LBH, earth, concrete), CEHATCHCHANGE/AUDIT, CEMEMBER corner cases: Esc at each prompt, undo of a whole member, UCS/rotated views, paper space vs model space scale, metre drawings, layer creation vs existing layers.'),
 @('cx_h10_privacy', 'CODEX_HUNT_PRIVACY_22OCT.md', 'PRIVACY AND SECURITY: what leaves the PC (startup heartbeat to CE Cloud: exactly which fields; telemetry; AI features; network calls), secrets or tokens in code, logs or settings (SEC-001 is closed: re-verify), log contents (drawing names, user names), log growth and rotation, file permissions, unsafe deserialization, path traversal on imports, DLL loading from user-writable folders.'),
 @('cx_h11_perf', 'CODEX_HUNT_PERF_22OCT.md', 'PERFORMANCE on a 10,000-entity survey drawing: anything O(n squared) per pick, per command or per idle tick; UI-thread blocking; startup time (Civil + Manager + Structural loading together); handlers that run on every selection change or document change; memory leaks from static caches; log flooding.'),
